795
00:53:04.000 --> 00:53:07.000
Hello, mother of Margo.
I am Niko.

796
00:53:07.000 --> 00:53:09.000
I present you
with pig to confirm

797
00:53:09.000 --> 00:53:13.000
my engagement to your daughter.

798
00:53:13.000 --> 00:53:15.000
Hey, what now?

799
00:53:15.000 --> 00:53:18.000
What's going on?
Uh, remember little boots?

800
00:53:18.000 --> 00:53:21.000
Hello, my schmoopsie poo.
Whoa, hey!

801
00:53:21.000 --> 00:53:24.000
He seems to think you're engaged.

802
00:53:24.000 --> 00:53:26.000
What? We're
not engaged.

803
00:53:26.000 --> 00:53:31.000
Look, Niko, you seem like a very
nice boy with a very nice pig.

804
00:53:31.000 --> 00:53:34.000
Uh... But you're
not engaged.

805
00:53:34.000 --> 00:53:36.000
Okay? It's not
happening.

806
00:53:36.000 --> 00:53:38.000
I understand.

807
00:53:38.000 --> 00:53:40.000
Who was I kidding?

808
00:53:40.000 --> 00:53:44.000
A dumpling like me
with a goddess like you.

809
00:53:44.000 --> 00:53:48.000
But I promise, I will
never forget you, Margo.

810
00:53:48.000 --> 00:53:50.000
Never.

811
00:53:51.000 --> 00:53:53.000
Oh, I'm pretty sure I won't
forget you either.

812
00:53:53.000 --> 00:53:56.000
Bye. Bye, Niko.

813
00:53:56.000 --> 00:53:58.000
Wow! That was crazy.
Whoa!

814
00:53:58.000 --> 00:54:01.000
That was totally humiliating.

815
00:54:01.000 --> 00:54:04.000
Taking a bite of that cheese was the
stupidest thing I've ever done.

816
00:54:04.000 --> 00:54:05.000
Why did I listen to you?

817
00:54:05.000 --> 00:54:08.000
Right. But it's over
now, so...

818
00:54:08.000 --> 00:54:11.000
Oh! Here we go.
Niko...

819
00:54:11.000 --> 00:54:15.000
You refuse my
son's engagement pig?

820
00:54:15.000 --> 00:54:16.000
What?

821
00:54:16.000 --> 00:54:18.000
May you and your
daughter die a slow death

822
00:54:18.000 --> 00:54:21.000
and be buried with onions.

823
00:54:23.000 --> 00:54:24.000
All right, lady, that's it!

824
00:54:24.000 --> 00:54:25.000
Nobody...

825
00:54:25.000 --> 00:54:30.000
Nobody curses my daughter!
Ya got that?

826
00:54:30.000 --> 00:54:33.000
Because if you mess with
Margo, you mess with me!

827
00:54:33.000 --> 00:54:37.000
And I promise, you do
not wanna mess with me.

828
00:54:37.000 --> 00:54:40.000
Do you understand me?

829
00:54:40.000 --> 00:54:41.000
Yes. Yes.

830
00:54:41.000 --> 00:54:44.000
Good.
Now get!

831
00:54:47.000 --> 00:54:50.000
Look, Margo, I think
we just need to... Oh.

832
00:54:53.000 --> 00:54:54.000
Yes!

833
00:54:54.000 --> 00:54:58.000
I have to tell GRU!

834
00:55:12.000 --> 00:55:14.000
Can we go back now?

835
00:55:14.000 --> 00:55:18.000
Already? Just
a couple more hours.

836
00:55:18.000 --> 00:55:20.000
We have to be home
before it gets dark.

837
00:55:20.000 --> 00:55:23.000
I don't understand.

838
00:55:23.000 --> 00:55:25.000
I did exactly what the man said.

839
00:55:25.000 --> 00:55:29.000
You mean that one-eyed scar-faced
man that everybody laughed at?

840
00:55:29.000 --> 00:55:31.000
Yeah, it makes no sense.

841
00:55:31.000 --> 00:55:33.000
Look, Agnes, maybe we're not...

842
00:55:44.000 --> 00:55:49.000
Ooh, my whole life has been
building to this moment.

843
00:55:53.000 --> 00:55:55.000
Um... It's a...

844
00:55:55.000 --> 00:55:58.000
Unicorn!

845
00:55:58.000 --> 00:56:02.000
I can't believe it!

846
00:56:02.000 --> 00:56:05.000
I'm gonna name you Lucky!

847
00:56:05.000 --> 00:56:08.000
Oh, Lucky, stop it!

848
00:56:08.000 --> 00:56:12.000
Yeah, I'll let someone
else burst her bubble.

849
00:56:18.000 --> 00:56:22.000
Look at us! Two brothers
pulling a heist!

850
00:56:22.000 --> 00:56:24.000
And that diamond will
make us the richest,

851
00:56:24.000 --> 00:56:27.000
most powerful
villains in the world!

852
00:56:27.000 --> 00:56:29.000
Right, brother?

853
00:56:29.000 --> 00:56:33.000
Oh, right. Yep, yeah.

854
00:56:35.000 --> 00:56:38.000
Bravo! Bravissimo!

855
00:56:38.000 --> 00:56:40.000
You're amazing!
I'm so sorry.

856
00:56:40.000 --> 00:56:41.000
I'm so embarrassed.
I was very rude.

857
00:56:41.000 --> 00:56:43.000
And you were always such a gentleman.
You did it!

858
00:56:43.000 --> 00:56:46.000
You did it!
You got our jobs back!

859
00:56:51.000 --> 00:56:54.000
What?
Oh, yeah, right. Sure.

860
00:56:54.000 --> 00:56:56.000
Oh, look.
We're here!

861
00:57:03.000 --> 00:57:06.000
I'm going in. Take the wheel.

862
00:57:06.000 --> 00:57:08.000
I still don't see why
I can't go with you.

863
00:57:08.000 --> 00:57:09.000
Hey, hey!
We discussed this.

864
00:57:09.000 --> 00:57:12.000
Now is not the time
to mess with the plan.

865
00:57:12.000 --> 00:57:14.000
Fine.

866
00:57:25.000 --> 00:57:27.000
Ha-ha!

867
00:57:27.000 --> 00:57:28.000
Hey, brother!

868
00:57:28.000 --> 00:57:31.000
What? I told you, you are
supposed to stay with the boat!

869
00:57:31.000 --> 00:57:35.000
Oh, I didn't think you
meant that literally.

870
00:57:35.000 --> 00:57:37.000
What other way
could I have meant it?

871
00:57:37.000 --> 00:57:41.000
All right. Let's move.
Just follow my lead.

872
00:57:41.000 --> 00:57:43.000
Got it.

873
00:57:43.000 --> 00:57:44.000
Whoa!

874
00:57:44.000 --> 00:57:46.000
Help me!

875
00:57:46.000 --> 00:57:48.000
Ow, ow, ow!

876
00:57:48.000 --> 00:57:50.000
Oh, no! The poison spikes!

877
00:57:50.000 --> 00:57:53.000
I'm gonna be impaled!

878
00:57:55.000 --> 00:57:57.000
I'm okay.

879
00:57:57.000 --> 00:57:59.000
I miss the minions.

880
00:57:59.000 --> 00:58:01.000
Come on!

881
00:58:06.000 --> 00:58:08.000
Coming.

882
00:58:14.000 --> 00:58:16.000
Coming.

883
00:58:19.000 --> 00:58:21.000
Come on.

884
00:58:26.000 --> 00:58:28.000
It's a scanning device.

885
00:58:28.000 --> 00:58:30.000
Quick!
Camouflage mode.

886
00:58:30.000 --> 00:58:33.000
Freeze! And
close your eyes!

887
00:58:33.000 --> 00:58:35.000
And cover your mouth!

888
00:58:40.000 --> 00:58:43.000
Okay, take my hand.

889
00:59:05.000 --> 00:59:09.000
Ha-ha! Follow me.

890
00:59:25.000 --> 00:59:27.000
Ha-ha!

891
00:59:31.000 --> 00:59:34.000
Look out!

892
00:59:37.000 --> 00:59:41.000
Oh, you were right. I should
have stayed in the boat.

893
00:59:41.000 --> 00:59:43.000
My stomach feels all queasy.

894
00:59:43.000 --> 00:59:47.000
I shouldn't have
eaten that pot pie.

895
00:59:48.000 --> 00:59:52.000
Hey, hey, relax.
You're gonna be just fine.

896
00:59:52.000 --> 00:59:54.000
I got your back.

897
01:00:00.000 --> 01:00:03.000
Come on. This way.

898
01:00:38.000 --> 01:00:40.000
Huh?

899
01:00:42.000 --> 01:00:44.000
Hmm?

900
01:01:33.000 --> 01:01:35.000
Looks like it's right above us.

901
01:01:35.000 --> 01:01:38.000
Okay, what do I do?
Should I wait in the vent?

902
01:01:38.000 --> 01:01:40.000
No, come with me.

903
01:01:53.000 --> 01:01:55.000
Dru, get off the bed!

904
01:01:55.000 --> 01:01:58.000
Yes, I'd like to
thank the Academy...

905
01:02:00.000 --> 01:02:01.000
I can help.
No, no, no.

906
01:02:01.000 --> 01:02:03.000
What? I can do it.
Don't! Don't! Don't!

907
01:02:03.000 --> 01:02:04.000
Why, yes.

908
01:02:04.000 --> 01:02:07.000
Yes, Molly Ringwald, I will take
you to the prom.

909
01:02:07.000 --> 01:02:11.000
What? Who? Where? What?
Who's there? Who is there?

910
01:02:18.000 --> 01:02:21.000
99 of red balloons

911
01:02:21.000 --> 01:02:23.000
Whoops! Almost forgot!

912
01:02:33.000 --> 01:02:36.000
Over here.

913
01:02:37.000 --> 01:02:39.000
Stay close.

914
01:02:41.000 --> 01:02:43.000
What?

915
01:02:43.000 --> 01:02:44.000
Dolls.

916
01:02:44.000 --> 01:02:46.000
Looks like Bratt
was the only one

917
01:02:46.000 --> 01:02:48.000
stupid enough to buy this junk.

918
01:02:48.000 --> 01:02:52.000
Oh, I used to have one of these!

919
01:02:56.000 --> 01:02:59.000
Ow!
Hey! Shh! Come on.

920
01:03:06.000 --> 01:03:09.000
All right.
We're getting close.

921
01:03:09.000 --> 01:03:11.000
From now on,
every move must be made

922
01:03:11.000 --> 01:03:14.000
with total
precision and purpose.

923
01:03:16.000 --> 01:03:17.000
Gum!

924
01:03:17.000 --> 01:03:18.000
Focus!

925
01:03:18.000 --> 01:03:21.000
We're after the diamond,
not the bubblegum.

926
01:03:21.000 --> 01:03:23.000
Got it!

927
01:03:25.000 --> 01:03:27.000
Mmm. Yum.

928
01:03:28.000 --> 01:03:30.000
This way!

929
01:03:30.000 --> 01:03:34.000
And now, to put this
where it belongs.

930
01:03:34.000 --> 01:03:35.000
What...

931
01:03:35.000 --> 01:03:40.000
Look at it, Clive.
It's beautiful!

932
01:03:45.000 --> 01:03:48.000
Will you please shut up?
He's gonna spot us!

933
01:03:49.000 --> 01:03:54.000
Spit it out! Spit it out!
I told you not to touch anything!

934
01:03:57.000 --> 01:04:00.000
Intruders!
Intruders! Intruders!

935
01:04:02.000 --> 01:04:04.000
Freeze, dipsticks!

936
01:04:04.000 --> 01:04:06.000
GRU? There's two
of you now?

937
01:04:06.000 --> 01:04:10.000
Then this will be twice as much fun.

938
01:04:10.000 --> 01:04:12.000
GRU.

939
01:04:16.000 --> 01:04:18.000
Give me back my diamond!

940
01:04:18.000 --> 01:04:20.000
Total lockdown!

941
01:04:20.000 --> 01:04:23.000
Oh!
Go get 'em, Bratt Pack!

942
01:04:31.000 --> 01:04:34.000
They're gonna get us!
They're gonna get us!

943
01:04:35.000 --> 01:04:38.000
Run!

944
01:04:48.000 --> 01:04:49.000
Oh, no!

945
01:04:49.000 --> 01:04:51.000
What does that mean?

946
01:04:51.000 --> 01:04:54.000
Are we gonna die?
Are we gonna die?

947
01:04:54.000 --> 01:04:56.000
We're gonna die!
Dru!

948
01:05:04.000 --> 01:05:07.000
What?

949
01:05:07.000 --> 01:05:09.000
Hey, guys. Hold on!

950
01:05:09.000 --> 01:05:11.000
Lucy!

951
01:05:17.000 --> 01:05:20.000
Thank you for saving us.
Whoo!

952
01:05:20.000 --> 01:05:23.000
Look! We got the diamond
and we're going to...

953
01:05:23.000 --> 01:05:26.000
Take it to the AVL
and get our jobs back.

954
01:05:26.000 --> 01:05:28.000
Wait!

955
01:05:28.000 --> 01:05:29.000
What? Oh,
that's amazing!

956
01:05:29.000 --> 01:05:31.000
And the best part is,
you'll never...

957
01:05:31.000 --> 01:05:33.000
ever go behind my back...

958
01:05:33.000 --> 01:05:37.000
ever again, right, honey bear?

959
01:05:37.000 --> 01:05:39.000
Yeah! Yeah, right.

960
01:05:39.000 --> 01:05:42.000
Lesson learned.

961
01:05:54.000 --> 01:05:55.000
I'll get the girls
and start packing.

962
01:05:55.000 --> 01:05:57.000
And tell them the good news!

963
01:05:57.000 --> 01:05:59.000
Ah! We're getting
our jobs back. Yeah!

964
01:05:59.000 --> 01:06:02.000
Yes! Yes!
Go tell the girls.

965
01:06:02.000 --> 01:06:03.000
Dru...

966
01:06:03.000 --> 01:06:06.000
No! No way! We can't
give the diamond back!

967
01:06:06.000 --> 01:06:08.000
I have to.

968
01:06:08.000 --> 01:06:10.000
No, you don't!
Yes, I do.

969
01:06:10.000 --> 01:06:11.000
- Give it!
- No!

970
01:06:11.000 --> 01:06:13.000
Give it!
Ow!

971
01:06:13.000 --> 01:06:16.000
What is wrong with you?

972
01:06:16.000 --> 01:06:17.000
You kicked me!

973
01:06:17.000 --> 01:06:18.000
You... You lied to me!

974
01:06:18.000 --> 01:06:20.000
Hey, I would have
told you the truth.

975
01:06:20.000 --> 01:06:23.000
But you're too much
of a wimp to handle it.

976
01:06:23.000 --> 01:06:24.000
That's it.
I'm out of here.

977
01:06:24.000 --> 01:06:27.000
You have no right to take that.
We stole it together.

978
01:06:27.000 --> 01:06:29.000
Together?

979
01:06:29.000 --> 01:06:31.000
You got to be kidding me.

980
01:06:31.000 --> 01:06:33.000
You did nothing but screw up
the whole time.

981
01:06:33.000 --> 01:06:35.000
I got this in spite of you.

982
01:06:35.000 --> 01:06:38.000
Oh, yeah? At least I didn't
get fired from my job

983
01:06:38.000 --> 01:06:40.000
like a total loser.

984
01:06:40.000 --> 01:06:42.000
At least I had a job.

985
01:06:42.000 --> 01:06:44.000
What have you accomplished
that was so great?

986
01:06:44.000 --> 01:06:47.000
I'll tell you what. Nothing!

987
01:06:47.000 --> 01:06:51.000
No wonder Dad thought
you were such a failure.

988
01:06:53.000 --> 01:06:55.000
We are no longer brothers.

989
01:06:55.000 --> 01:06:57.000
That's fine with me.

990
01:07:39.000 --> 01:07:43.000
GRU! I found
a unicorn!

991
01:07:44.000 --> 01:07:47.000
My life is complete!

992
01:07:49.000 --> 01:07:51.000
Honey, that's...

993
01:07:51.000 --> 01:07:54.000
That's not actually a unicorn.

994
01:07:54.000 --> 01:07:55.000
Huh?

995
01:07:55.000 --> 01:07:59.000
But, but, he has one horn.

996
01:07:59.000 --> 01:08:02.000
I'm...
I'm sorry, sweetie...

997
01:08:02.000 --> 01:08:05.000
but he's just a goat.

998
01:08:05.000 --> 01:08:08.000
Life is just
like that sometimes.

999
01:08:08.000 --> 01:08:13.000
We're hoping for a unicorn,
and we get a goat.

1000
01:08:15.000 --> 01:08:17.000
Well, you know what?

1001
01:08:17.000 --> 01:08:21.000
Lucky is the best goat
in the whole wide world!

1002
01:08:21.000 --> 01:08:25.000
Look at that face! I
just want to squeeze it.

1003
01:08:25.000 --> 01:08:27.000
Mmm!

1004
01:08:27.000 --> 01:08:30.000
Whoo-hoo!
Whoo!

1005
01:08:30.000 --> 01:08:31.000
I'll take this.

1006
01:08:31.000 --> 01:08:35.000
You've been a bad boy, GRU.

1007
01:08:35.000 --> 01:08:37.000
Can you get the rest
of the suitcases?

1008
01:08:37.000 --> 01:08:38.000
Come on, girls.
Let's go!

1009
01:08:38.000 --> 01:08:43.000
Let's get physical, physical

1010
01:08:49.000 --> 01:08:51.000
Change of plans, girls.

1011
01:08:51.000 --> 01:08:54.000
Instead of going home...

1012
01:08:54.000 --> 01:08:56.000
Eyebrows! Ow!

1013
01:08:56.000 --> 01:08:59.000
We're going to Hollywood!

1014
01:09:00.000 --> 01:09:03.000
Now, that's what I call acting.

1015
01:09:03.000 --> 01:09:07.000
Let's go, Clive!
We've got a giant robot waiting!

1016
01:09:10.000 --> 01:09:12.000
Huh?

1017
01:09:12.000 --> 01:09:14.000
Lucy?

1018
01:09:14.000 --> 01:09:16.000
But...

1019
01:09:16.000 --> 01:09:18.000
Bratt! He took the girls!

1020
01:09:18.000 --> 01:09:20.000
What? No!

1021
01:09:22.000 --> 01:09:24.000
Dru! Dru!

1022
01:09:24.000 --> 01:09:27.000
Go away!
I don't wanna talk to you.

1023
01:09:27.000 --> 01:09:30.000
Bratt has the girls!

1024
01:09:36.000 --> 01:09:39.000
Listen, brother.
About what I said...

1025
01:09:39.000 --> 01:09:40.000
No, I'm the one...

1026
01:09:40.000 --> 01:09:42.000
But I shouldn't have...

1027
01:09:42.000 --> 01:09:45.000
I'm... I'm sorry.

1028
01:09:45.000 --> 01:09:48.000
I'm so sorry, GRU.

1029
01:09:48.000 --> 01:09:50.000
Aw!

1030
01:09:50.000 --> 01:09:51.000
Ooh, look out!

1031
01:09:51.000 --> 01:09:53.000
What is that?

1032
01:10:01.000 --> 01:10:03.000
Mel?

1033
01:10:03.000 --> 01:10:05.000
GRU?

1034
01:10:38.000 --> 01:10:42.000
Hello, Hollywood!

1035
01:10:42.000 --> 01:10:45.000
I'm back and bigger than ever.

1036
01:10:47.000 --> 01:10:48.000
I'm scared!

1037
01:10:48.000 --> 01:10:52.000
Thank you.
Thank you so... Oh!

1038
01:10:55.000 --> 01:10:56.000
No! No!

1039
01:10:56.000 --> 01:10:58.000
No, you can't leave me here!

1040
01:10:58.000 --> 01:10:59.000
I'm famous!

1041
01:10:59.000 --> 01:11:03.000
Clive, arm the canons.

1042
01:11:05.000 --> 01:11:08.000
Chew on this!

1043
01:11:24.000 --> 01:11:27.000
Hey, mullet head!
Let us out!

1044
01:11:27.000 --> 01:11:33.000
Oh, don't worry, girls. I've
prepared a front row seat for you.

1045
01:11:48.000 --> 01:11:51.000
Agnes!

1046
01:11:52.000 --> 01:11:55.000
Once again, I win and GRU loses!

1047
01:11:55.000 --> 01:11:58.000
Enjoy the show, girls.

1048
01:12:05.000 --> 01:12:07.000
What in the heck?
Oh!

1049
01:12:07.000 --> 01:12:09.000
I hope the girls are okay.

1050
01:12:09.000 --> 01:12:12.000
Bratt! Bratt at nine o'clock...
No! Three o'clock!

1051
01:12:12.000 --> 01:12:14.000
He's on the left!

1052
01:12:15.000 --> 01:12:18.000
No!
I've seen this episode!

1053
01:12:18.000 --> 01:12:21.000
He's going to bubblegum the whole
city and send it up into space!

1054
01:12:21.000 --> 01:12:24.000
Hurry!

1055
01:12:33.000 --> 01:12:36.000
This is it! This is it!

1056
01:12:36.000 --> 01:12:38.000
Lights! Camera!

1057
01:12:38.000 --> 01:12:40.000
Laser!

1058
01:12:50.000 --> 01:12:52.000
Yeah!

1059
01:12:57.000 --> 01:12:58.000
Look!

1060
01:12:58.000 --> 01:13:01.000
I've got the girls. You
two, go take care of Bratt.

1061
01:13:01.000 --> 01:13:03.000
Wait! What are
you doing?

1062
01:13:09.000 --> 01:13:10.000
Look, you guys, it's Lucy!

1063
01:13:10.000 --> 01:13:13.000
Lucy, over here!
Help! Help us!

1064
01:13:13.000 --> 01:13:14.000
Mama's comin', girls.

1065
01:13:14.000 --> 01:13:17.000
- Lucy! Lucy!
- We're up here!

1066
01:13:17.000 --> 01:13:19.000
Look at that laser go.

1067
01:13:19.000 --> 01:13:21.000
I love it when
a plan comes together.

1068
01:13:21.000 --> 01:13:24.000
It's GRU!

1069
01:13:26.000 --> 01:13:27.000
Get ready, Bratt.

1070
01:13:27.000 --> 01:13:31.000
You're about to be
blasted back to the '80s!

1071
01:13:37.000 --> 01:13:39.000
Whoo-hoo!

1072
01:13:42.000 --> 01:13:45.000
We got him!

1073
01:13:53.000 --> 01:13:55.000
Oh, no!
Don't worry.

1074
01:13:55.000 --> 01:13:57.000
There's more
where that came from.

1075
01:13:57.000 --> 01:13:59.000
It'll take more
than that to stop me.

1076
01:13:59.000 --> 01:14:03.000
Bratt Pack, go get that barf bag.

1077
01:14:10.000 --> 01:14:13.000
Oh, incoming!

1078
01:14:15.000 --> 01:14:16.000
You little...

1079
01:14:16.000 --> 01:14:19.000
Get away!
Get out of there!

1080
01:14:24.000 --> 01:14:26.000
Quick, jump!

1081
01:14:27.000 --> 01:14:29.000
Bonus!

1082
01:14:29.000 --> 01:14:32.000
Did you see that, Clive? All gone.

1083
01:14:32.000 --> 01:14:34.000
Buh-bye,
Wonder Twins.

1084
01:15:02.000 --> 01:15:04.000
Help!

1085
01:15:04.000 --> 01:15:06.000
Hang on!

1086
01:15:13.000 --> 01:15:16.000
Hang on, girls!
I've got you!

1087
01:15:16.000 --> 01:15:20.000
I can't! I'm slipping!

1088
01:15:20.000 --> 01:15:22.000
No!

1089
01:15:22.000 --> 01:15:24.000
Got ya!

1090
01:15:26.000 --> 01:15:28.000
Thank you, Lucy!

1091
01:15:28.000 --> 01:15:31.000
Let's go!
We're not safe yet.

1092
01:15:33.000 --> 01:15:36.000
Minions!

1093
01:15:59.000 --> 01:16:01.000
Look at what we have here.

1094
01:16:01.000 --> 01:16:06.000
Sorry, GRU. This is going to
be a total burn!

1095
01:16:11.000 --> 01:16:14.000
Oh, no! No, no, no!

1096
01:16:18.000 --> 01:16:21.000
I've been a bad boy!

1097
01:16:29.000 --> 01:16:33.000
Nobody messes with my brother!

1098
01:16:44.000 --> 01:16:47.000
What? What's happening? No!

1099
01:16:59.000 --> 01:17:01.000
Dru!

1100
01:17:01.000 --> 01:17:03.000
Hold on! I'm coming.

1101
01:17:07.000 --> 01:17:10.000
You've ruined everything!

1102
01:17:10.000 --> 01:17:12.000
And now, it's time to die.

1103
01:17:12.000 --> 01:17:15.000
Any last words, GRU?

1104
01:17:15.000 --> 01:17:17.000
You know what?

1105
01:17:17.000 --> 01:17:20.000
I got two words for you.

1106
01:17:20.000 --> 01:17:22.000
Dance fight.

1107
01:17:22.000 --> 01:17:26.000
Oh, it is on like Donkey Kong.

1108
01:17:26.000 --> 01:17:30.000
I am going to enjoy this.

1109
01:17:48.000 --> 01:17:50.000
Enough!

1110
01:17:50.000 --> 01:17:52.000
My turn!

1111
01:18:12.000 --> 01:18:14.000
Uh-oh.

1112
01:18:16.000 --> 01:18:19.000
Game over!

1113
01:18:21.000 --> 01:18:24.000
Is this what you're looking for?

1114
01:18:24.000 --> 01:18:26.000
No!

1115
01:18:35.000 --> 01:18:38.000
No!

1116
01:18:40.000 --> 01:18:43.000
Curse you, GRU!

1117
01:18:43.000 --> 01:18:46.000
Curse you!

1118
01:18:54.000 --> 01:18:57.000
Dru? Dru?

1119
01:19:04.000 --> 01:19:06.000
Hey! We did it!

1120
01:19:06.000 --> 01:19:09.000
Yes, we did, brother.

1121
01:19:09.000 --> 01:19:11.000
- GRU!
- Uncle Dru!

1122
01:19:11.000 --> 01:19:13.000
GRU!
Girls!

1123
01:19:26.000 --> 01:19:27.000
GRU!

1124
01:19:27.000 --> 01:19:30.000
Hey, Mel. Welcome back.

1125
01:20:00.000 --> 01:20:02.000
Mmm.

1126
01:20:02.000 --> 01:20:05.000
Love you, Mom.

1127
01:20:09.000 --> 01:20:10.000
I'm a mom.

1128
01:20:10.000 --> 01:20:14.000
I'm a mom!

1129
01:20:28.000 --> 01:20:30.000
Boys, time for bed!

1130
01:20:30.000 --> 01:20:32.000
We're back at work
in the morning.

1131
01:20:32.000 --> 01:20:34.000
I'm coming, sweetie.

1132
01:20:34.000 --> 01:20:35.000
Good night, Lucy.

1133
01:20:35.000 --> 01:20:37.000
See you tomorrow, brother.

1134
01:20:37.000 --> 01:20:39.000
Hey, I'm back on the job.

1135
01:20:39.000 --> 01:20:42.000
So no villainy tonight,
huh? Got it?

1136
01:20:42.000 --> 01:20:45.000
I make no promises.
Love you!

1137
01:20:45.000 --> 01:20:47.000
Uh-huh. Right.

1138
01:20:47.000 --> 01:20:49.000
I love you, too.

1139
01:20:49.000 --> 01:20:51.000
Aw!

1140
01:20:51.000 --> 01:20:55.000
"Aw!" All right, every...
Go! Go! Go to bed!

1141
01:20:59.000 --> 01:21:02.000
Hey! Guys! Come on!

1142
01:21:19.000 --> 01:21:20.000
What...
What is happening?

1143
01:21:20.000 --> 01:21:23.000
It's coming from outside!

1144
01:21:24.000 --> 01:21:28.000
Hey! I thought we
said no more villainy!

1145
01:21:28.000 --> 01:21:29.000
Sorry, brother!

1146
01:21:29.000 --> 01:21:34.000
Somebody's gotta keep the
family tradition alive, right?

1147
01:21:43.000 --> 01:21:45.000
Let's get him.
Ugh.

1148
01:21:45.000 --> 01:21:48.000
Honey, he's my brother.

1149
01:21:48.000 --> 01:21:50.000
We'll give him a
five-minute head start.

1150
01:21:50.000 --> 01:21:57.000
